{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01XcQSMCCdSiahc6AxgHjdmW", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Suku_Kubu\"}, {\"url\": \"https://infokuliah.palcomtech.ac.id/kuliahpedia/wiki/Suku_Anak_Dalam\"}, {\"url\": \"https://kumparan.com/oktavia-anisa/suku-kubu-dan-orang-rimba-melestarikan-adat-di-tengah-desakan-perubahan-dunia-24A9MsShnpP\"}, {\"url\": \"https://regional.kompas.com/read/2022/02/10/193628678/suku-kubu-asal-usul-mata-pencaharian-dan-bahasa\"}, {\"url\": \"https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kura-kura\"}, {\"url\": \"https://m.nomor.net/_kodepos.php?_i=republik-indonesia&id=93926\"}, {\"url\": \"https://wikiwand.com/id/articles/Suku_Kubu\"}, {\"url\": \"https://sastraindonesiaku.wordpress.com/kebudayaan-suku-kubu-jambi/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kubu\"}, {\"url\": \"https://profilbaru.com/Suku_Kubu\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:27:46.787Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Suku Kubu Wikipedia berburu kura-kura menggunakan alat tradisional", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01Gk6UxLmG19ADUmqbiwig7Q", "content": [{"title": "Suku Kubu - Wikipedia bahasa Indonesia, ensiklopedia bebas", "url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Suku_Kubu"}, {"title": "Suku Kubu - Wikipedia bahasa Indonesia, ensiklopedia bebas", "url": "https://infokuliah.palcomtech.ac.id/kuliahpedia/wiki/Suku_Anak_Dalam"}, {"title": "Suku Kubu dan Orang Rimba: Melestarikan Adat di Tengah Desakan Perubahan Dunia", "url": "https://kumparan.com/oktavia-anisa/suku-kubu-dan-orang-rimba-melestarikan-adat-di-tengah-desakan-perubahan-dunia-24A9MsShnpP"}, {"title": "Suku Kubu: Asal-usul, Mata Pencaharian, dan Bahasa", "url": "https://regional.kompas.com/read/2022/02/10/193628678/suku-kubu-asal-usul-mata-pencaharian-dan-bahasa"}, {"title": "Kura-kura - Wikipedia bahasa Indonesia, ensiklopedia bebas", "url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kura-kura"}, {"title": "Suku Kubu", "url": "https://m.nomor.net/_kodepos.php?_i=republik-indonesia&id=93926"}, {"title": "Suku Kubu - Wikiwand", "url": "https://wikiwand.com/id/articles/Suku_Kubu"}, {"title": "Kebudayaan Suku Kubu Jambi", "url": "https://sastraindonesiaku.wordpress.com/kebudayaan-suku-kubu-jambi/"}, {"title": "Kubu", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kubu"}, {"title": "Suku Kubu - Profilbaru.com", "url": "https://profilbaru.com/Suku_Kubu"}]}, "The Indonesian Wikipedia article on Suku Kubu lists a traditional turtle-catching tool. It says the teru is still used to catch turtles, along with a serampang for spearing fish in rivers. The same passage notes that a homemade firearm called kecepak is more effective for hunting pigs, deer or mouse-deer, which has largely replaced the traditional kujur spear for that purpose.\n\nOther results repeat the same tool list. A Wikiwand copy of the article describes the group's hunting gear as kujur, teruk, serampang, but it does not mention the teru turtle trap. A mirror of the article cites the same teru and serampang passage but marks a related hunting claim with a \"butuh rujukan\" (citation needed) tag.\n\nFor context, the Wikipedia article on turtles in general says turtles have been hunted for their meat, used in traditional medicine, and their shells have been utilized. That is a general reference and does not describe the Suku Kubu's methods.\n\nCaveat: the search returned several copies of the same Wikipedia text, and I did not open the live article, so the exact wording may differ slightly from the current version."], "durationSeconds": 7.205403290999999, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01XcQSMCCdSiahc6AxgHjdmW", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgEMbxpUs8pYpbe7vunku", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**Jawaban singkat:** Suku Kubu menangkap kura-kura dengan alat tradisional bernama **teru** (di salinan lain ditulis *teruk*). Menurut Wikipedia bahasa Indonesia, alat ini masih dipakai untuk menangkap kura-kura. Ikan di sungai ditombak dengan **serampang**.\n\n**Catatan keandalan:**\n- Saya hanya membaca ringkasan hasil pencarian, bukan halaman Wikipedia-nya langsung.\n- Salinan Wikiwand menyebut daftar alat \"kujur, teruk, serampang\" tanpa menyebut kura-kura. Jadi ejaan dan fungsi *teru/teruk* belum dipastikan.\n- Satu tiruan artikel itu memberi tanda \"butuh rujukan\" (perlu sumber) pada klaim perburuan yang terkait.\n- Tiga pencarian pertama tidak menemukan sumber lain yang menyebut alat penangkap kura-kura.\n\nSources:\n- [Suku Kubu – Wikipedia bahasa Indonesia](https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Suku_Kubu)\n- [Suku Kubu – Wikiwand](https://wikiwand.com/id/articles/Suku_Kubu)\n- [The Jakarta Post: Kubu tribespeople struggle without traditions](https://www.thejakartapost.com/news/2009/09/09/kubu-tribespeople-struggle-without-traditions)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1352, "cache_read_input_tokens": 7649, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1352}, "output_tokens": 524, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:27:51.173Z", "request_id": "req_011CgEMbxYrVqeRx3jawwppb"}
